1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,150
Here's the one matrix rule
worth memorizing.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:08,600
An m by k matrix times a k by n
matrix gives m by n.

3
00:00:09,217 --> 00:00:12,442
The inner sizes must match,
and they disappear.

4
00:00:12,742 --> 00:00:14,867
The outer sizes survive.

5
00:00:15,883 --> 00:00:19,783
So 2 by 3, times 3 by 2, gives 2 by 2.

6
00:00:20,383 --> 00:00:23,208
Flip the order, and you get 3 by 3.

7
00:00:24,217 --> 00:00:27,692
Every shape inside an LLM
follows that rule.

8
00:00:27,992 --> 00:00:30,967
It's the one matrix rule worth memorizing.
